                                "sense_id": "e8cff25c-d3f7-3e48-98e8-52bc76c242d3",
                                "text": "The gates of the toun hath he upplight, and on his bak ycaried them hath he, [...]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2d0d7b0f-7aa4-4085-a10d-d4c4f9dfdbfe",
                                "sense_id": "e8cff25c-d3f7-3e48-98e8-52bc76c242d3",
                                "text": "For to the seated hills they flew, Which loos'ning to and fro, Quickly upplucked by the roots And on their en'mys throw, [...]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4b4f12f7-23d2-4e82-9f0e-469d120b66ff",
                                "sense_id": "e8cff25c-d3f7-3e48-98e8-52bc76c242d3",
                                "text": "The tree of justice, plant thou: the root of ill-wishers, up-pluck."
